WEBVTT

00:00:18.250 --> 00:00:19.010
Hey...

00:00:19.010 --> 00:00:19.880
Help!

00:00:20.010 --> 00:00:21.040
Wait!

00:00:21.040 --> 00:00:22.120
Just wait a sec!

00:00:22.310 --> 00:00:24.420
No! Let go of me!

00:00:24.840 --> 00:00:28.080
Aren't you Fujii Mio-san from my class?

00:00:28.080 --> 00:00:29.650
Please, Oshikiri-kun!

00:00:29.650 --> 00:00:31.440
Let me go home!

00:00:31.440 --> 00:00:33.970
Don't do anything horrible to me!

00:00:35.400 --> 00:00:36.800
What are you talking about?

00:02:28.080 --> 00:02:29.700
<i>Fujii Mio...</i>

00:02:29.700 --> 00:02:32.330
<i>She's in class like nothing ever happened.</i>

00:02:32.330 --> 00:02:34.220
<i>Her usual bright and cheery self.</i>

00:02:34.220 --> 00:02:36.290
<i>Like a different person from last night.</i>

00:02:36.930 --> 00:02:38.340
<i>A different person...</i>

00:02:38.340 --> 00:02:40.190
<i>Yeah, that's probably it.</i>

00:02:40.990 --> 00:02:43.810
<i>I didn't see the same
Fujii I'm looking at now.</i>

00:02:43.970 --> 00:02:47.300
<i>Maybe it was another Fujii,
from a different world.</i>

00:02:50.540 --> 00:02:53.220
<i>She wandered into this world</i>

00:02:53.220 --> 00:02:54.980
<i>and met me for a moment,</i>

00:02:54.980 --> 00:02:57.290
<i>before passing back into hers.</i>

00:02:58.400 --> 00:03:02.190
<i>There seem to be entrances in my 
house that lead to another world...</i>

00:03:02.190 --> 00:03:04.530
<i>A world that looks just like this one.</i>

00:03:05.600 --> 00:03:08.410
<i>Maybe she belongs to one of those.</i>

00:03:09.380 --> 00:03:13.270
<i>But why would she appear in my house?</i>

00:03:13.270 --> 00:03:14.640
Oshikiri-kun.

00:03:15.410 --> 00:03:17.340
Oh, Fujii-kun...

00:03:17.340 --> 00:03:18.820
Do you need something?

00:03:18.820 --> 00:03:19.880
The class journal.

00:03:20.050 --> 00:03:20.960
Here you go.

00:03:20.960 --> 00:03:23.100
It's your turn, remember?

00:03:23.100 --> 00:03:25.220
Oh, yeah... Thanks.

00:03:25.510 --> 00:03:29.790
Are you sure you don't have something 
you want to say to me, Oshikiri-kun?

00:03:30.510 --> 00:03:32.340
No... not really.

00:03:32.340 --> 00:03:33.920
I wasn't looking at you.

00:03:33.920 --> 00:03:36.340
Liar. You totally were.

00:03:37.610 --> 00:03:38.960
Well, whatever.

00:03:38.960 --> 00:03:40.900
Take care of the journal, okay?

00:03:41.840 --> 00:03:44.020
Well, well...

00:03:44.020 --> 00:03:45.920
Oshikiri-kun.

00:03:45.920 --> 00:03:48.480
You into Fujii or something?

00:03:48.480 --> 00:03:50.480
Such a bashful young pup.

00:03:50.480 --> 00:03:53.220
I wouldn't if I were you, though.

00:03:53.220 --> 00:03:55.320
You're smaller than she is.

00:03:55.320 --> 00:03:58.160
Imagine how lame you'd
look walking next to her.

00:03:58.160 --> 00:04:00.050
You're getting on my nerves, Aoyama.

00:04:00.050 --> 00:04:01.630
Pipe down, would you?

00:04:02.720 --> 00:04:07.340
You've got a big mouth for such a runt!

00:04:07.340 --> 00:04:08.550
You shrimp!

00:04:08.550 --> 00:04:09.750
Tiny little bitch!

00:04:09.750 --> 00:04:11.810
How about saying something back, shorty?

00:04:11.810 --> 00:04:14.290
Runt! Runt! Runt! You know you are—

00:04:12.320 --> 00:04:14.280
Son of a bitch!

00:04:14.940 --> 00:04:15.810
How's that?!

00:04:22.230 --> 00:04:23.590
Stop it!

00:04:23.590 --> 00:04:25.150
Enough already!

00:04:25.660 --> 00:04:27.240
Suck on that.

00:04:27.240 --> 00:04:29.190
Are you okay, Oshikiri-kun?

00:04:29.190 --> 00:04:30.260
Yeah...

00:04:31.600 --> 00:04:34.430
<i>Damn it, that bastard Aoyama...</i>

00:04:38.120 --> 00:04:40.390
Oshikiri...

00:04:40.390 --> 00:04:42.350
Oshikiri...

00:04:43.400 --> 00:04:45.140
Oshikiri!

00:04:45.140 --> 00:04:47.040
Oshikiri, where are you?! Get out here!

00:04:47.040 --> 00:04:48.530
<i>That voice...</i>

00:04:48.530 --> 00:04:49.750
Oshikiri...

00:04:49.750 --> 00:04:50.790
Oshikiri!

00:04:50.790 --> 00:04:52.310
<i>Aoyama?</i>

00:04:59.440 --> 00:05:01.510
Oshikiri...

00:05:01.870 --> 00:05:04.150
Oshikiri!

00:05:04.420 --> 00:05:06.360
M-Monster!

00:05:07.280 --> 00:05:11.070
I'll... kill you!

00:05:22.720 --> 00:05:24.600
What in the...

00:05:30.590 --> 00:05:35.410
Hey, Oshikiri-kun, I heard your house 
is like a big Western mansion.

00:05:35.410 --> 00:05:36.350
Is that true?

00:05:37.150 --> 00:05:39.780
I'd love to visit sometime.

00:05:39.780 --> 00:05:41.760
I wouldn't if I were you.

00:05:41.760 --> 00:05:42.480
Why not?

00:05:43.010 --> 00:05:45.050
I also wouldn't ask about it.

00:05:45.050 --> 00:05:46.440
What are you talking about?

00:05:46.880 --> 00:05:49.200
Oh, I see. You're shy, huh?

00:05:49.200 --> 00:05:50.580
That's not it.

00:05:50.580 --> 00:05:53.520
You're always by yourself, Oshikiri-kun.

00:05:53.520 --> 00:05:56.050
I don't think that's a good thing.

00:05:56.050 --> 00:05:59.670
You need to make friends, 
or you'll grow into a real weirdo.

00:06:01.710 --> 00:06:03.840
Oh, wow!

00:06:04.260 --> 00:06:07.210
I had no idea there was a
house like this in town...

00:06:07.210 --> 00:06:09.050
This is your last chance to turn back.

00:06:09.050 --> 00:06:11.170
You're still on about that?

00:06:11.170 --> 00:06:12.810
It's for your own good.

00:06:13.750 --> 00:06:16.180
This house has entrances
to another world.

00:06:16.180 --> 00:06:17.990
Entrances to another world?

00:06:17.990 --> 00:06:19.120
Yeah.

00:06:19.120 --> 00:06:23.280
There are places that connect to that
world and let people pass through.

00:06:24.090 --> 00:06:27.280
The other world looks a lot like ours.

00:06:27.280 --> 00:06:31.410
I even saw someone who looked
exactly like me, once.

00:06:32.230 --> 00:06:36.800
You shouldn't poke your nose into supernatural
stuff like that out of idle curiosity.

00:06:36.800 --> 00:06:40.700
I don't believe in that kind of stuff, anyway.

00:06:40.700 --> 00:06:43.560
As for seeing someone who 
looked exactly like you...

00:06:43.560 --> 00:06:46.370
Believe me, I wish I was hallucinating.

00:06:46.370 --> 00:06:47.350
Hang on!

00:06:47.350 --> 00:06:49.090
I can help you with this!

00:06:50.200 --> 00:06:51.500
Fine...

00:06:51.500 --> 00:06:53.010
Come on in.

00:06:53.010 --> 00:06:55.380
But try to be careful, okay?

00:06:57.170 --> 00:06:58.440
Huh?

00:06:58.440 --> 00:06:59.700
Fujii-kun?

00:07:06.000 --> 00:07:07.780
<i>It's been three days,</i>

00:07:07.780 --> 00:07:10.800
<i>but Fujii Mio hasn't come to school,
and has been reported missing.</i>

00:07:11.810 --> 00:07:13.350
<i>Maybe, back then...</i>

00:07:13.350 --> 00:07:16.560
<i>she wandered into the other world.</i>

00:07:21.780 --> 00:07:24.330
<i>Damn it, what now?</i>

00:07:28.370 --> 00:07:31.330
O-Oshikiri-kun...

00:07:31.330 --> 00:07:33.410
I found you...

00:07:33.410 --> 00:07:34.540
Turn me...

00:07:34.540 --> 00:07:37.300
Turn my body back to normal!

00:07:37.300 --> 00:07:38.600
That voice...

00:07:38.600 --> 00:07:39.760
Fujii Mio?!

00:07:40.430 --> 00:07:42.430
Oshikiri-kun!

00:07:43.000 --> 00:07:44.880
I can't believe you did this to me...

00:07:45.120 --> 00:07:47.300
I'll curse you...

00:07:47.300 --> 00:07:50.340
I'll curse you!

00:08:07.120 --> 00:08:10.930
<i>Was that... Fujii Mio?</i>

00:08:11.690 --> 00:08:13.110
<i>But wait...</i>

00:08:13.110 --> 00:08:15.360
<i>Which one was it?</i>

00:08:15.360 --> 00:08:17.180
<i>The one from my side?</i>

00:08:18.210 --> 00:08:19.760
<i>Either way,</i>

00:08:20.320 --> 00:08:24.290
<i>it seems like something dreadful
is going on in the other world.</i>

00:08:27.850 --> 00:08:28.690
Huh?

00:08:29.570 --> 00:08:31.240
This is the first floor...

00:08:31.240 --> 00:08:33.500
but I was on the second.

00:08:33.500 --> 00:08:35.360
How did I get down here?

00:08:35.360 --> 00:08:37.410
Stop this! Please!

00:08:37.900 --> 00:08:38.630
Who's there?!

00:08:38.630 --> 00:08:41.120
Please, let me go!

00:08:41.120 --> 00:08:42.390
Oshikiri-kun!

00:08:47.600 --> 00:08:50.180
<i>That's... the other me.</i>

00:08:50.180 --> 00:08:51.380
Don't do this!

00:08:51.380 --> 00:08:53.450
<i>And Fujii Mio...</i>

00:08:53.450 --> 00:08:55.290
I'm afraid I can't stop.

00:08:55.890 --> 00:08:58.560
I've only just begun my research.

00:08:58.880 --> 00:09:01.920
I tried the treatment on Aoyama-kun first,

00:09:01.920 --> 00:09:04.480
but he grew too large. It was a failure.

00:09:04.480 --> 00:09:06.350
Next was Fujii Mio.

00:09:06.350 --> 00:09:09.040
I experimented with your
counterpart from this world,

00:09:09.040 --> 00:09:11.300
but she became no more than a pile of flesh.

00:09:11.300 --> 00:09:14.070
I cast both of the failures
into the other world...

00:09:14.070 --> 00:09:16.780
Your world, that is.

00:09:16.780 --> 00:09:20.450
And then you wandered in,

00:09:20.450 --> 00:09:25.570
which is excellent timing, because 
now I can test my adjusted formula.

00:09:25.570 --> 00:09:29.230
Here's hoping it can boost height
without any unpleasant side effects.

00:09:29.230 --> 00:09:30.160
Height?

00:09:31.200 --> 00:09:33.510
Stop this! Please!

00:09:33.510 --> 00:09:35.170
Don't worry so much.

00:09:35.170 --> 00:09:38.600
No! No! Don't!

00:09:38.600 --> 00:09:39.910
Stop!

00:09:44.000 --> 00:09:45.280
You...

00:09:48.130 --> 00:09:49.890
So...

00:09:49.890 --> 00:09:52.510
You've finally come here yourself, eh?

00:09:52.510 --> 00:09:53.440
What?

00:09:54.190 --> 00:09:55.860
Then, this is...

00:09:55.860 --> 00:09:57.410
The other world.

00:09:57.410 --> 00:09:59.170
To you people, at least.

00:10:04.370 --> 00:10:05.550
Stop it!

00:10:05.550 --> 00:10:08.500
What a perfect chance to 
test it on my doppelganger!

00:10:09.250 --> 00:10:10.280
Enough!

00:10:26.100 --> 00:10:27.540
Oshikiri-kun!

00:10:27.540 --> 00:10:29.270
Y-You bastard!

00:10:39.620 --> 00:10:41.830
Oshikiri-kun! No! No!

00:10:41.830 --> 00:10:44.180
Turn him back!

00:10:44.180 --> 00:10:45.800
You demon! Monster!

00:10:45.800 --> 00:10:47.760
Turn him back to normal!

00:10:47.760 --> 00:10:48.510
Fujii-kun...

00:10:48.510 --> 00:10:49.840
No! Stay back!

00:10:50.130 --> 00:10:51.730
No!

00:10:51.730 --> 00:10:53.780
Fujii-kun, get a grip!

00:10:53.780 --> 00:10:55.160
It's me, Oshikiri!

00:10:56.710 --> 00:10:57.970
No way...

00:10:57.970 --> 00:10:59.360
It's true.

00:10:59.360 --> 00:11:02.430
I took the needle off
him when I threw him.

00:11:03.060 --> 00:11:06.920
The monster you see is the 
one who made that formula.

00:11:07.390 --> 00:11:08.800
Bastard...

00:11:08.800 --> 00:11:12.430
Don't think killing me means you're safe!

00:11:12.890 --> 00:11:16.130
There are infinite parallel worlds...

00:11:16.130 --> 00:11:20.860
Never forget there are infinite 
killer Oshikiris out there!

00:11:32.070 --> 00:11:33.550
Oshikiri-kun...

00:11:34.110 --> 00:11:38.400
Will we be able to make
it back to our world?

00:11:40.010 --> 00:11:45.010
<b>The Ongoing Tale of Oshikiri</b>

00:11:40.010 --> 00:11:45.010
Collection No. 040

00:11:46.760 --> 00:11:47.940
Good morning!

00:11:47.930 --> 00:11:49.300
Morning.

00:11:50.280 --> 00:11:51.410
Hey!

00:11:51.410 --> 00:11:54.430
Man, I can't believe summer break is over...

00:11:54.820 --> 00:11:56.730
Good morning, Wakayama-kun.

00:11:56.730 --> 00:11:57.730
Morning.

00:11:57.730 --> 00:11:59.740
Wakayama! Just the man I've been waiting for!

00:11:59.740 --> 00:12:01.740
Can I see your math homework?

00:12:01.740 --> 00:12:02.890
Please?

00:12:02.890 --> 00:12:03.650
Sure.

00:12:03.930 --> 00:12:06.190
You really oughta do your own once in a while.

00:12:06.910 --> 00:12:07.920
Sorry to impose!

00:12:13.310 --> 00:12:14.040
Souichi!

00:12:14.890 --> 00:12:17.620
You were told to stop shooting nails, man!

00:12:17.620 --> 00:12:20.330
When Yanagida-sensei shows up, 
I'm telling on you!

00:12:22.480 --> 00:12:24.690
Hey, here he comes!

00:12:24.690 --> 00:12:27.030
Sensei, listen to this!

00:12:27.030 --> 00:12:30.600
Souichi has been shooting
nails around... again...

00:12:31.890 --> 00:12:33.390
Sensei?

00:12:36.610 --> 00:12:41.620
<b>Cloth Teacher</b>

00:12:36.610 --> 00:12:41.620
Collection No. 049

00:12:51.180 --> 00:12:52.030
Huh?

00:12:52.580 --> 00:12:55.560
Yanagida-sensei, what are you doing?

00:12:57.460 --> 00:12:58.650
Oh my God!

00:13:04.610 --> 00:13:07.620
Souichi! Now you've done it!

00:13:13.300 --> 00:13:15.580
Yanagida-sensei is being weird...

00:13:15.580 --> 00:13:18.580
When you look up close,
his face is weird, too.

00:13:18.580 --> 00:13:19.480
It's like...

00:13:20.190 --> 00:13:22.550
it's made of cloth.

00:13:22.550 --> 00:13:23.490
Cloth?

00:13:24.570 --> 00:13:28.870
<b>Class 6-1</b>

00:13:24.690 --> 00:13:29.150
So, basically, this goes like this,
and that goes like that.

00:13:29.150 --> 00:13:30.600
You get it?

00:13:32.170 --> 00:13:33.190
Sir!

00:13:33.190 --> 00:13:34.410
I don't get it at all!

00:13:34.890 --> 00:13:37.010
And this is supposed to be science class!

00:13:37.010 --> 00:13:38.360
What?!

00:13:38.360 --> 00:13:41.780
Class Monitor Wakayama Kousetsu, 
you little shit.

00:13:41.780 --> 00:13:44.300
After all this explaining, you still 
don't understand?! Idiot!

00:13:44.300 --> 00:13:47.050
Give me 100 laps around the field!

00:13:47.050 --> 00:13:48.930
Get moving, now!

00:13:55.180 --> 00:13:58.140
Well, look at the class monitor
doing laps around the building!

00:13:58.320 --> 00:13:59.520
Souichi!

00:13:59.520 --> 00:14:01.690
What did you do to Yanagida-sensei?!

00:14:02.200 --> 00:14:04.900
Whatever do you mean? Doesn't ring a bell.

00:14:04.900 --> 00:14:06.220
Don't play dumb!

00:14:07.260 --> 00:14:08.400
Nyah!

00:14:08.400 --> 00:14:09.370
Wait!

00:14:11.060 --> 00:14:11.750
See ya!

00:14:22.370 --> 00:14:24.590
Wakayama, you filth!

00:14:24.590 --> 00:14:28.860
You dare expose my behind
to the light of day?!

00:14:28.860 --> 00:14:32.220
There's a high cost for casting
eyes on my bottom!

00:14:32.220 --> 00:14:33.800
I'll curse you!

00:14:33.800 --> 00:14:36.860
I'll bring you to ruin!

00:14:42.580 --> 00:14:45.170
What's with the beard, Wakayama?

00:14:45.170 --> 00:14:48.200
No clue. I just woke up and it had grown in.

00:14:48.600 --> 00:14:51.320
The beard makes you look
pretty rugged, Kousetsu-kun.

00:14:51.320 --> 00:14:52.460
Yeah!

00:14:52.460 --> 00:14:53.900
This isn't funny!

00:14:54.400 --> 00:14:56.160
I'm still in elementary school!

00:14:56.160 --> 00:14:58.160
Wakayama Kousetsu!

00:14:58.160 --> 00:14:59.620
Little bastard!

00:14:59.620 --> 00:15:03.120
An elementary schooler, 
growing a beard?! What arrogance!

00:15:03.120 --> 00:15:05.700
Shave it off right now!

00:15:07.700 --> 00:15:10.560
Here, I'll shave it off for you.

00:15:10.990 --> 00:15:12.600
Slice, slice!

00:15:13.520 --> 00:15:15.470
Why are you backing away?!

00:15:15.470 --> 00:15:17.760
Slice, slice, slice!

00:15:22.490 --> 00:15:24.100
Wakayama...

00:15:24.100 --> 00:15:28.070
Yanagida-sensei is angry now!

00:15:28.070 --> 00:15:31.650
You're not our teacher! 
You're some sort of cloth impostor!

00:15:39.890 --> 00:15:41.450
Yanagida-sensei!

00:15:41.450 --> 00:15:43.700
What are you doing?!

00:15:44.790 --> 00:15:47.630
Th-The principal is calling for you!

00:15:47.630 --> 00:15:50.120
Please go to his office right now!

00:15:51.110 --> 00:15:52.610
The principal, huh?

00:15:52.610 --> 00:15:54.450
I wonder what he wants.

00:15:55.280 --> 00:15:57.380
Maybe I'm getting a bonus!

00:15:59.120 --> 00:16:01.040
Are you all right, Wakayama-kun—

00:16:01.040 --> 00:16:02.260
Is that a beard?

00:16:02.260 --> 00:16:03.060
Yeah...

00:16:04.600 --> 00:16:05.810
What is that?

00:16:05.810 --> 00:16:07.810
Yanagida-sensei's finger.

00:16:07.810 --> 00:16:10.590
But... it's cloth.

00:16:10.590 --> 00:16:12.500
He really is a fake.

00:16:15.770 --> 00:16:19.090
Apparently Yanagida went
nuts in the principal's office

00:16:19.090 --> 00:16:21.410
and then ran off somewhere.

00:16:21.410 --> 00:16:24.790
Still, Soga-sensei is taking 
awfully long to show up.

00:16:24.790 --> 00:16:26.130
It's gonna be night soon.

00:16:26.130 --> 00:16:27.680
Did she actually promise you?

00:16:28.000 --> 00:16:29.570
I'm positive.

00:16:29.570 --> 00:16:31.880
She said to meet her in
front of her apartment.

00:16:33.300 --> 00:16:34.770
Is that her?

00:16:46.420 --> 00:16:49.860
S-Soga-sensei's been turned into cloth, too!

00:16:52.440 --> 00:16:53.750
R-Run for it!

00:17:04.900 --> 00:17:05.620
Kouta!

00:17:11.410 --> 00:17:12.320
Hey!

00:17:25.780 --> 00:17:27.900
I know Souichi has to be behind this.

00:17:29.070 --> 00:17:31.810
Hey, look, something's moving.

00:17:33.940 --> 00:17:35.060
It's Souichi!

00:17:41.440 --> 00:17:42.250
What now?

00:17:42.250 --> 00:17:43.310
Let's check it out.

00:17:43.310 --> 00:17:44.660
I'll keep watch down here.

00:17:46.780 --> 00:17:47.810
Well?

00:17:48.290 --> 00:17:49.610
It's hard to say...

00:17:50.850 --> 00:17:51.690
What is it?

00:17:55.200 --> 00:17:56.200
Someone's there...

00:18:01.350 --> 00:18:02.410
Another one!

00:18:06.900 --> 00:18:08.970
He looks like you...

00:18:08.970 --> 00:18:10.130
I get it!

00:18:10.130 --> 00:18:12.730
Souichi must've made those puppet fakes.

00:18:12.730 --> 00:18:14.510
He replaced the real teachers.

00:18:14.510 --> 00:18:15.640
And now I'm next.

00:18:16.900 --> 00:18:18.350
Let's take it apart right now!

00:18:18.350 --> 00:18:19.070
No, wait!

00:18:20.500 --> 00:18:22.660
If this thing starts moving,

00:18:22.660 --> 00:18:27.320
that'll be how we learn what happened
to Yanagida-sensei and Soga-sensei.

00:18:27.320 --> 00:18:29.500
What if you die or something?!

00:18:29.500 --> 00:18:31.300
I refuse to die.

00:18:31.900 --> 00:18:33.600
Anyway, let's head back for tonight.

00:18:33.600 --> 00:18:35.190
If that thing goes nuts,

00:18:35.190 --> 00:18:37.310
you need to take it down, Kouta.

00:18:41.470 --> 00:18:43.390
There's a big ruckus outside...

00:18:46.240 --> 00:18:47.280
That's...

00:18:47.280 --> 00:18:49.300
Don't screw with me!

00:18:49.880 --> 00:18:51.230
Let's move, Wakayama!

00:18:51.230 --> 00:18:51.940
Right.

00:18:56.400 --> 00:18:59.520
Starting today, you are Wakayama Kousetsu!

00:18:59.520 --> 00:19:03.820
You're going to go to school buck naked 
and run 100 laps around the field!

00:19:04.100 --> 00:19:06.570
That's the price you pay

00:19:06.570 --> 00:19:09.030
for exposing my butt!

00:19:09.030 --> 00:19:10.190
Souichi!

00:19:11.330 --> 00:19:13.760
You're supposed to be in school. 
What are you doing?

00:19:14.210 --> 00:19:16.850
Y-You scared me there...

00:19:16.850 --> 00:19:19.090
What's up with the doll?

00:19:19.090 --> 00:19:20.200
Explain.

00:19:21.010 --> 00:19:22.660
See ya!

00:19:22.660 --> 00:19:23.920
Wait!

00:19:26.490 --> 00:19:27.520
Yeowch...

00:19:29.690 --> 00:19:30.700
What the hell?!

00:19:37.300 --> 00:19:38.650
What's going on?

00:19:42.840 --> 00:19:44.280
All right!

00:19:44.500 --> 00:19:46.470
Now this should be quite a show!

00:19:49.460 --> 00:19:51.020
Hey, Souichi!

00:19:51.020 --> 00:19:53.010
Let's play with nails some more!

00:19:53.010 --> 00:19:55.110
Oh, it's you, Yanagida.

00:19:55.110 --> 00:19:58.630
I'm amusing myself with 
Wakayama at the moment.

00:20:00.160 --> 00:20:00.860
Ow!

00:20:03.150 --> 00:20:04.560
What is that thing?!

00:20:04.560 --> 00:20:06.640
Don't screw with me!

00:20:10.850 --> 00:20:13.570
Don't screw with me!

00:20:11.600 --> 00:20:13.560
What's wrong, Wakayama?!

00:20:13.560 --> 00:20:16.900
I... I suddenly lost my strength.

00:20:17.310 --> 00:20:22.080
That puppet we saw in the attic
must be draining my soul...

00:20:22.080 --> 00:20:23.120
Say what?!

00:20:24.300 --> 00:20:25.430
Squeak?

00:20:26.420 --> 00:20:27.740
You boys!

00:20:28.190 --> 00:20:31.930
You really screwed with me yesterday!

00:20:31.930 --> 00:20:33.790
Especially you, beardo!

00:20:33.790 --> 00:20:37.260
Say your prayers!

00:20:37.890 --> 00:20:39.080
Another one?!

00:20:41.440 --> 00:20:42.670
Squeak squeak?

00:20:46.380 --> 00:20:47.840
Hold it!

00:20:47.840 --> 00:20:52.180
You're the one who burned
my face, aren't you?!

00:20:55.760 --> 00:20:57.020
Souichi!

00:20:55.990 --> 00:20:57.020
Huh?

00:20:57.020 --> 00:20:58.400
Is that Yanagida?

00:20:57.020 --> 00:20:59.230
Wait up!

00:20:58.400 --> 00:21:00.480
What happened to him?

00:21:05.250 --> 00:21:06.340
Right where it hurts!

00:21:07.690 --> 00:21:09.470
Got you, I got you!

00:21:10.230 --> 00:21:12.080
Hold it...

00:21:14.960 --> 00:21:16.500
Let go! Let go already!

00:21:17.040 --> 00:21:19.010
Now!

00:21:19.010 --> 00:21:22.170
Let go! Let go!

00:21:22.170 --> 00:21:25.400
Enough already... Please stop it...

00:21:25.400 --> 00:21:30.000
Stop it... Stop it... Not worth it...

00:21:26.090 --> 00:21:26.980
Urgh!

00:21:34.880 --> 00:21:40.110
<i>And so, this bizarre incident that started
our second semester came to a close.</i>

00:21:41.410 --> 00:21:44.800
<i>That very day, Soga-sensei was 
found collapsed in her apartment,</i>

00:21:45.320 --> 00:21:48.820
<i>and Yanagida-sensei was found
staring at a bonfire in the park.</i>

00:21:48.820 --> 00:21:50.540
<i>They were both rescued.</i>

00:21:51.160 --> 00:21:54.910
<i>I'm feeling a lot better, 
and the beard is gone.</i>

00:21:55.420 --> 00:21:58.020
<i>As for Souichi...</i>

00:23:34.970 --> 00:23:40.020
Collection
